      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Homie, I remember everything (Uh)",
          "rhyme":"iN",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Every single blunt lit",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Me and my homies, we was all up on that dumb shit",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Hittin' that one lick (One lick), gettin' us dumb rich (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Bein' extra sneaky, not leavin' thumb prints (Huh)",
          "rhyme":"int",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"There was little Mac killin' packs of Fun Dip (You know me)",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"And my people that been wit' me since a young kid (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Gettin' caught by my Pops blowin' haze (Uh)",
          "rhyme":"az",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Smokin' blunts from my younger through my older days (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Nothin' goes to waste, not a day is smashed",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"There was dough to make (Dough to make)",
          "rhyme":"Ek",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"And we was makin' cash (Makin' cash)",
          "rhyme":"aS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Bangin' rap till the neighbors called the cops (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"Op",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Beatin' dudes up, throwin' mollywops, yeah (Get 'em)",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Some people say that I'm all just talk",
          "rhyme":"Ok",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"But I'll tell you everything about the block I walked",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"I wasn't cookin' pies (Cookin' pies)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"I wasn't tokin' guns (Tokin' guns)",
          "rhyme":"9n",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"But I was lookin' high",
          "rhyme":"Eg",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"Stayin' smokin' blunts (Smokin' blunts)",
          "rhyme":"(",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Yeah, I stole a little bit, boy, nothin' is cheap (Nah)",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Santa stayed puttin' the coal under my tree",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"And this is peace to my peoples (Peoples)",
          "rhyme":"ipl",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"And peace to my enemies (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"But nothin' keeps me alive like my memories",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGHBIJKLMNOBPQRFOSBB",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAAAAAABACCBDCDEAFCGAEAAA"
