        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Got the illest crowd (Illest crowd)",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Raisin' the roof, uh, breakin' the ceilin' down (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"awn",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"I'm iller now than when y'all first heard me (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Peace to my peoples who listened past the first week",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"(Listened past the first week) And there's a lot of y'all (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"ol",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"So let me take a bow (Take a bow), this to memories (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"The drinks is on the house (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"awz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"We came a long damn way from sittin' on the couch (On the couch)",
          "rhyme":"uS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Peace to all my honeys that was takin' off they blouse",
          "rhyme":"uz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"You'll miss me when I'm out (I'm out)",
          "rhyme":"awt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"You'll need me when I'm gone (Gone)",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"You hatin' forty-year-olds, I'm peein' on your lawn (Tss)",
          "rhyme":"awn",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
